        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 end-to-end | زمن p95",
      "description": "95th percentile of a whole check. Thresholds: green < 6 s, amber 6-8 s, red >= 8 s (objective p95 < 8 s). No data: no checks ran in this time range; run make seed, make replay or make demo, or send a real check.",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Runbook: latency-burn",
